{"id":"998788239280a337","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-prop-orderedpair-definition.md","title":"Ordered Pair Definition","display":"prop-orderedpair-definition — Ordered Pair Definition","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-orderedpair-definition","aliases":["58-prop-orderedpair-definition"],"display":"prop-orderedpair-definition — Ordered Pair Definition","depends_on":["[[58-df-ordered-pair]]","[[58-df-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-orderedpair-definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-orderedpair-definition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-orderedpair-definition — Ordered Pair Definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bea77fab814b3292\" href=\"?note=bea77fab814b3292\" title=\"58-df-ordered-pair\">58-df-ordered-pair</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,c,d\\in V\">\\(a,b,c,d\\in V\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}orderedpair\\text{-}definition} \\vdash \\langle a,b\\rangle=\\{\\{a\\},\\{a,b\\}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}orderedpair\\text{-}definition} \\vdash \\langle a,b\\rangle=\\{\\{a\\},\\{a,b\\}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}orderedpair\\text{-}injective} \\vdash \\langle a,b\\rangle=\\langle c,d\\rangle\\leftrightarrow(a=c\\land b=d)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}orderedpair\\text{-}injective} \\vdash \\langle a,b\\rangle=\\langle c,d\\rangle\\leftrightarrow(a=c\\land b=d)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Kuratowski's definition of ordered pair.</li>\n<li>The second assertion records the defining injectivity property of the Kuratowski encoding.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ordered-pair","status":"resolved","id":"bea77fab814b3292","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordered-pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a,b,c,d\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}orderedpair\\text{-}definition} \\vdash \\langle a,b\\rangle=\\{\\{a\\},\\{a,b\\}\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}orderedpair\\text{-}injective} \\vdash \\langle a,b\\rangle=\\langle c,d\\rangle\\leftrightarrow(a=c\\land b=d)","display":true}],"bytes":788,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3983","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-prop-orderedpair-definition.md|58-prop-orderedpair-definition]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["bea77fab814b3292","65d9a1e690c32aad"]}